<BaseLayout title="Cookie policy" description="MotionHotel cookie policy template."><section class="page"><p class="eyebrow">COOKIES</p><h1>Only what is needed.</h1><p>Services used on this website may use cookies or similar technologies.</p></section><section class="section prose legal-prose"><p class="legal-notice">Theme template only — update this page and implement consent management as required for the services used on the live site.</p><h2>Spam protection</h2><p>Google reCAPTCHA is loaded when a contact or booking request is submitted and may use cookies or similar technologies to detect abuse. Review Google's <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> and update this policy with the applicable cookies, duration, legal basis and consent requirements.</p><h2>Other services</h2><p>If you add analytics, a booking engine, maps, videos or social-media embeds, explain their purpose, provider, duration and legal basis here. Obtain consent where this is required by applicable law.</p><h2>Managing consent</h2><p>Describe how visitors can change or withdraw consent through the consent tool used on your production website.</p></section></BaseLayout>
